        "original_id": "2849c666-ebbe-53bb-9a84-54a1c4914a6e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Naomi Jacobson, Seretse Khama, Lord Baden-Powell, Nelson Mandela, Oliver Tambo, Shaka, Cetshwayo, Steve Biko\n- Roles: President of Botswana\n- Topics: Statues, Public figures\n\nFacts:\n- Seretse Khama was born on 1 July 1921 and died on 13 July 1980.\n- Seretse Khama was the first President of Botswana and served in office from 1966 to 1980.\n- During her career, Naomi Jacobson made statues of Lord Baden-Powell, Nelson Mandela, Oliver Tambo, Shaka, Cetshwayo, Steve Biko, and Sir Seretse Khama.",
